{"id":"n15040-1-7","stage":3,"title":"드물다 · 少","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n15040-1-7-1","ko":"언니는 항상 이렇게 늦게 오니?","zh":"姐姐怎么总是这么晚才回来啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"언니는","meaning":"姐姐、大姐（女性对年长女性的亲切称呼）","explanation":"언니：姐姐、大姐（女性对年长女性的亲切称呼）；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"언니","audio":"/audio/9ab740751e1be982fcd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31971","senseId":"3","lemma":"언니","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"언니는","audio":"/audio/577311129f79563d5ae1.mp3"}},{"text":"항상","meaning":"总，总是，老，老是，经常","explanation":"항상：总，总是，老，老是，经常","readings":[{"term":"항상","audio":"/audio/f1d42a32366087dde8c3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"83162","senseId":"1","lemma":"항상","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"항상","audio":"/audio/f1d42a32366087dde8c3.mp3"}},{"text":"이렇게","meaning":"这样","explanation":"이렇다：这样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"이렇다","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71157","senseId":"1","lemma":"이렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이렇게","audio":"/audio/9a767a1c9118d82c3af9.mp3"}},{"text":"늦게","meaning":"晚，迟","explanation":"늦다：晚，迟；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"늦다","audio":"/audio/8678e3dcf30b4fad0aa5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64526","senseId":"1","lemma":"늦다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"늦게","audio":"/audio/f953561284e61df1c157.mp3"}},{"text":"오니?","meaning":"到，来到","explanation":"오다：到，来到；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"10","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오니","audio":"/audio/aa5f29e49987c6019006.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"9ab740751e1be982","term":"언니","zh":"姐姐、大姐（女性对年长女性的亲切称呼）","audio":"/audio/9ab740751e1be982fcd7.mp3","entryId":"31971","defin